  "description": "*“Above heaven and beneath heaven, I alone am supreme!”*\n\nCheonma Chi Yu-rang, the greatest master of the martial world, is trapped on an unknown island called Magyeong by a mysterious power. After living in solitude for ten years, he learns through a mysterious device that four worlds have merged. In order to communicate with the outside world and survive, he resolves to undergo reverse aging...\n\n*“Thank you, Heavenly Demon Kitty~ meow!”*\n\nReborn as a beautiful young Heavenly Demon girl, Cheonma Chi Yu-rang—no, Cheonma-chan—must now find out: Can she conquer Kwitch and escape the Demon Realm?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
